And it's a really, really tender moment, I thought, where it is this dad saying, like,

473
00:24:50.860 --> 00:24:51.560
you can do better.

474
00:24:51.820 --> 00:24:56.400
And I mean, I've had those moments in real life where my dad is, you know, like, I'm getting

475
00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:57.740
over a breakup or whatever.

476
00:24:57.920 --> 00:25:02.540
And my dad, who's, you know, not normally emotional like that, would try to help me feel

477
00:25:02.540 --> 00:25:02.720
better.

478
00:25:02.900 --> 00:25:05.040
And that's what this felt like with Michael and Aaron.

479
00:25:05.260 --> 00:25:09.320
