480
00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:10.240
between the two of us.

481
00:25:10.360 --> 00:25:14.400
And it just felt like Steve Carell is also saying, it's going to be okay.

482
00:25:14.540 --> 00:25:18.300
It felt like a part of the cast in real life.

483
00:25:18.460 --> 00:25:21.920
And it felt like I'm in the fabric of the show now.

484
00:25:22.080 --> 00:25:23.900
And it just felt very special.

485
00:25:24.120 --> 00:25:29.000
So to be able to do that, of course, is something that I'll remember forever.

486
00:25:29.000 --> 00:25:35.640
