487
00:25:35.640 --> 00:25:36.160
the question.

488
00:25:36.660 --> 00:25:38.100
I love that.

489
00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:40.820
And it was such a sweet way to end the episode.

490
00:25:41.180 --> 00:25:41.920
I know.

491
00:25:42.380 --> 00:25:42.660
Yeah.

492
00:25:42.660 --> 00:25:48.860
I love those moments when Michael gets the opportunity to rise to the occasion and he

493
00:25:48.860 --> 00:25:49.280
does.

494
00:25:49.500 --> 00:25:49.980
I know.

495
00:25:50.200 --> 00:25:51.600
And that was one of those moments.

496
00:25:51.960 --> 00:25:52.220
Yep.

497
00:25:52.220 --> 00:25:54.760
I loved that scene between the two of you.

498
00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:56.020
I loved it.

499
00:25:56.100 --> 00:26:02.420
