505
00:26:16.700 --> 00:26:18.420
I know it's all been said before, but it really does.

506
00:26:18.420 --> 00:26:23.940
And in a way that's so different from shows both then and now, which, like, you know,

507
00:26:24.040 --> 00:26:25.700
makes it, I think, stand apart.

508
00:26:25.960 --> 00:26:28.920
And I'm saying this as a fan, like, before being on the show.

509
00:26:29.060 --> 00:26:33.040
I just, whether I consciously noticed that or not, it had to resonate in some way.

510
00:26:33.360 --> 00:26:36.580
So, yeah, that's my take on it.

