00:30:23.320 --> 00:30:23.980
I know.

617
00:30:24.420 --> 00:30:24.820
Fascinating.

618
00:30:26.180 --> 00:30:27.340
I think it is.

619
00:30:27.740 --> 00:30:28.300
Oh, Lord.

620
00:30:28.680 --> 00:30:30.480
Here were some of the alts they gave to Brian.

621
00:30:30.800 --> 00:30:31.660
Oh, my gosh.

622
00:30:31.760 --> 00:30:31.900
Jenna.

623
00:30:33.020 --> 00:30:34.120
Oscar, I'm going to be late today.

